WEBVTT

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.980
Congratulations.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.820
Now you are, in body and soul, prepared to fight the holy war.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.820
You are reborn as our comrade.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.120
Yes, sir.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.860
Answer me this.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.970
You probably don't fully understand the meaning of true martial arts yet, but...

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.600
How will you use your new powers?

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.050
To fight.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.320
To protect the one I must.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:10.770
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.740
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.240
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:21.740
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:27.550
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:31.490
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:39.590
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:46.900
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:52.440
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:59.570
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:05.050
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:07.490
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:14.430
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.700
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.770
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.270
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:27.810
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:33.620
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:01.170
Hasn't it stopped ringing yet?

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.910
W!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.180
Huh? What?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:12.620
Give me those headphones!

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:15.320
Huh?! No!

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.760
Give them to me!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.230
No!

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.450
Roan...

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.590
Look after Iruga-<i>san.</i>

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:00.960
Right!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.590
Keough... Roan...

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:33.290
Roan!

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:01.660
Magnum...

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:02.720
Break!

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:08.270
Reflect... Shield!

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:29.290
I am... no, I'm not...

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.460
I'm not as I was. Don't think I am!

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.060
Shield Charge!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.710
Roan!

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:01.590
Roan, I commend you on having done well thus far.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.490
Don't underestimate me!

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.590
What?!

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.270
Big Brother!

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.640
Grand...

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:19.570
Cross!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.970
Why? You'll be injured, too...

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.440
In order to protect the one dear to me...

00:06:56.440 --> 00:07:00.810
I don't care what happens to me!!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:16.000
You were the one who told me to protect Yuufa!

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:19.870
I've acquired the power to do so now!

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:26.910
Running from me?!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.200
Big Brother!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.270
Don't worry.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:05.010
From now on, I'll protect you.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.720
Iruga! Where are you?!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.090
Judia-<i>san...</i>

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.220
Roan! That costume...

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.720
Iruga!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:25.290
Wasn't that wound healed?!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.870
By the way, where are
Takius-<i>san</i> and the others?

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.960
Poring...

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:56.330
There! Take that!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.440
Love that expression.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.480
Human faces gripped with fear...

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.450
I always love seeing it.

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:20.520
What's that look in your eyes?!

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.550
Poring... Poring!

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.810
You...

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.470
despicable...

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.040
human!

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:48.080
Poring! Poring! Poring! Poring!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.120
Get away!

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:52.550
Stop acting so foolish!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:57.560
Humans and Monsters can never be friends!

00:09:57.560 --> 00:10:00.220
Humans and Monsters?

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:09.340
Do you mean me and Alice?

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.970
Silence!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.070
You're irritating.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:17.240
I'm sending you to hell!

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:23.080
Disappear, Little Girl...

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:30.190
Frost... Diver!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.490
What?

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:48.510
Bitch!

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:52.910
Maaya-<i>san</i>, are you all right?

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:00.420
Shall I kill you first?

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:05.130
Shield...

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:06.690
Boomerang!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:14.560
Big Bro!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:19.610
Yuufa! Hurry, heal Takius-<i>san</i> and the others!

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.510
Yes...

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:23.770
Heal!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:29.980
Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:32.950
Roan!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:35.650
Roan, is it you?

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:48.030
Now! Let me repay you for being so "kind" to Takius-<i>san</i> and Maaya!

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:28.980
Holy...

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:30.210
Cross!

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.550
Running away?!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:42.290
Run away? Don't be silly.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:46.420
I'm staying in this special seat to watch the show.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.910
Cold...

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.030
Bolt-

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.990
Accelerate!

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.980
Sis!

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.380
Yuufa!

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.380
Are you okay?!

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.050
You dirty! Dirty!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.200
Iruga!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:03.570
Dammit! Quit it, you windup freak!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.100
Charge...

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:07.610
Arrow!

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.180
Damn!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.920
Wait!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.820
Shield...

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.050
Boomerang!

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.830
Are you okay?

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.130
Roan!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.570
Devotion!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:02.430
Roan! Did you absorb the damage meant for me?!

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:06.870
Takius-<i>san</i>! I'll handle the defense!
Use your magic!

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:08.500
Oh... Yes!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.670
Judia-<i>san</i>! Yuufa! Help me with backup!

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.840
Heal!

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:17.750
Hit me with some, too!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.510
Blessing!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:25.690
Arrow... Shower!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.390
Lightning...

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.360
Bolt!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:50.130
Take that and that!

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.210
Don't you ever quit?!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:58.480
Iruga!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:03.390
Holy...

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.450
Cross!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.400
Reflect...

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.800
Shield!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:28.580
Awesome, Big Bro!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.480
That's power!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:33.390
Quit wasting time!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.250
Finish them off!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.090
Cold Bolt!

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:46.630
See?! Takius-<i>san</i> is doing her job!

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.940
Double Strafing!

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:54.880
Holy Light!

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:06.810
Grand...

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.360
Cross!

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:19.460
--Wow!
--Wow!

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:29.340
C'mon, you're next!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.570
Let's have you on the stage!

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:37.220
Sorry about that!

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.190
My performance fee is high!

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:41.350
What?!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.790
What the-

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:05.280
As long as the bell keeps ringing in this Clock Tower,

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:09.740
we can summon all the Monsters we want.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:17.320
I'll appear for the curtain call, if you want.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:22.630
Although, I'm sure none of you will be alive by then.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:33.660
Don't worry. I'm here.

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:41.170
Huh? What?

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.180
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.310
Please forgive me!

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.630
Bitch!

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:57.600
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.590
Meddler!

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.160
What's that?!

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.810
The bell!

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:11.070
Impossible! The mechanism has stopped!

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:24.830
Baphomet!

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:27.320
B-Baphomet?

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:40.110
You intrude into the land of my kinsmen. Insolent wretches.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:47.110
Well, never mind. You can just be prey for Baphomet.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.690
You humans, again?

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.730
Get them all!

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:00.130
Huh?

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:02.330
You!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:06.700
Daddy, Daddy, kill all of them, Daddy!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.430
You dirty ingrate!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:14.440
What does she mean?

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:19.150
Huh? Oh... ahh... I just... um...

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.380
Huh?!

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:24.850
Did these guys help you?

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:27.010
Y-Yes.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:37.970
Return courtesy with courtesy.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:41.600
That is my principle.

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:45.670
I've never liked his methods, anyway.

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:47.070
"Him"?

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:48.440
Yes.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:50.940
The Dark Lord!

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:57.080
He conspires in the background, never doing anything himself!

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.420
It is so like him.

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:06.290
Even now, he brews trouble in the ancient capital to the east.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.100
To the east?

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:11.060
The ancient capital?

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:13.170
--Fayon!
--Go!

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:15.300
If you linger here...

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:16.870
Next I'll...

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.860
What will you do next?!

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:23.670
Roan!

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:30.950
Yes... You do seem to have grown stronger.

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:35.420
Kid...

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:39.150
Don't think that strength is everything.

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:48.270
Roan, are you all right?

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:50.860
This was nothing.

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.480
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:06.490
Okay. Let's go to Fayon!

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:08.220
We can't...

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.790
Huh?

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:13.290
Iruga's wound is bad.
He's got to recuperate.

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:18.030
Oh, dear. Without those two, our fighting strength is cut in half.

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.640
Don't worry. I'm here!

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:24.800
From now on, I'll protect all of you!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:35.310
<i>This is Teiling. Roan and</i> <i>the others go to Fayon.</i>

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:39.650
<i>Roan shows off his powers</i> <i>and alienates his friends.</i>

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:42.150
<i>Next time,</i> "I Can't Save Anyone."

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:44.640
<i>Whatever will happen?</i>
